DeepScientist Lite is the official Codex plugin for the DeepScientist research workflow.
"DeepScientist" identifies the upstream research workflow and platform developed by ResearAI.
This plugin is maintained by the DeepScientist Lite maintainers and follows the DeepScientist
naming and branding guidelines:

  https://github.com/ResearAI/DeepScientist/blob/main/TRADEMARK.md

Upstream project: https://github.com/ResearAI/DeepScientist

Scientific Factor Card process provenance:
The authoritative source audited for this transfer is DeepScientist V2 v2.1.8:
https://github.com/WENGSYX/DeepScientist_V2/releases/tag/v2.1.8
Tag commit: 49ffdcda6ce159505f6119b1e26d79c8503a8286
Audited wq-alpha-research SKILL.md blob: 6f58083e8f0a951a0773d94f5b0812484febc8c3

That upstream repository declares AGPL-3.0-only at the repository level. DeepScientist Lite
does not copy upstream code, schemas, or skill text. It independently implements only
domain-neutral research-process ideas: keep unmeasured values unknown, bind promotion to real
checks and evidence, distinguish requested/pending work from verified state, retain failed probes,
and choose a bounded next test from an explicit mechanism hypothesis. No financial fields,
formulas, datasets, credentials, domain thresholds, registry implementation, or submission
automation from that distribution are included here.

